# Allow-list for the build context: exclude everything, then re-include only
# what the image needs. Unrelated changes (.venv, tests, notebooks, .git)
# never invalidate the image layers.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# read by the build backend because pyproject.toml references it
!README.md
!src/
# no bytecode, not even inside src/
**/__pycache__
